        "alt": "微動だにしない巨大専用椅子と、祝う一同の一枚絵"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "peony.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、食堂に極秘プロジェクトが進行していた。名称は「ピー計画」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "内容——ピオニーが体重を預けても壊れない、巨大専用椅子の製作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "設計と施工は整備班が名乗りを上げ、材料は解体式典の廃材を再利用した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そして今日が、椅子耐久試験の日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食堂には技術者たち（一応避難位置）、紙冠で正装した子どもたち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちのチーム全員が集まった。世界一真剣な、着席のための式典。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……すわるだけ、なのに。……てが、ふるえる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "三十七脚ぶんの雪辱戦です。いけます。設計値は完璧、施工は整備班の職人技。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あとは、堂々と座るだけ!"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "peony.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "着席。——静寂。椅子は、軋みひとつ立てなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "微動だにしない巨大専用椅子。隣の椅子が気圧されて横滑りしただけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "子どもたちの「すわれたー!」の大歓声。技術者は男泣き。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は耳を押さえて、拍手の音量に備えた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……すわれた。……わたし、ふつうに、すわれた……!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「座れた」だけの出来事を、最終決戦の勝利みたいに全員で祝う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "よその人には意味不明だろう。でも、この食堂の全員は知っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女がどれだけ「そーっと」の人生を歩いてきたか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日から彼女は、どすんと座って昼を食べられる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "式典の締めに、彼女は柿落としの出演届を読み上げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "演目は「巨大専用椅子、着席式」——備考「拍手は、ご自由に」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "みんなのまえで、もういちど、すわるの。……こんどは、ふるえないで、すわる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "昼食の時間になる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女の専用席の周りに、案内所の子たちが集まって、紙の冠の城下町ができていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "peony.epilogue.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "守る城を失くした巨人の周りに、小さな城が、また増えていく。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "peony.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
